    <h2>Commercial services</h2>
    <p>
      Alongside the editorial content, LanDeng is a supplier directory for three commercial paths:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Wholesale</strong> — existing products from the standard range, in stick (线香), cone
        (塔香), coil (盘香), sachet (香囊), and raw-material (香材) formats. See
        <a href="/wholesale/">Wholesale</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
